{"availability":"available","full":"alemoraru/nextjs-portofolio-website","name":"nextjs-portofolio-website","description":"A highly customizable, developer-focused portfolio template built with Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and MDX. SEO-optimized, responsive, and designed to showcase your work, projects, and ideas.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":27,"forks":4,"created":"2025-04-20T20:30:58Z","updated":"2026-10-04T20:16:29Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nextjs-portofolio-website.vercel.app","topics":["blog","carousel","create-next-app","cv","developer-portfolio","mdx","mobile-web-app","nextjs","nextjs-portfolio","nextjs-portfolio-template","npm","portfolio-website","responsive-web-design","seo","tailwindcss","template-project","typescript","typescript-react","vercel","work-experience"],"demo":"https://nextjs-portofolio-website.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:09.158Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:09.158Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:09.158Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:09.158Z","stars":27,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a custom personal website theme built using Next.js, bootstrapped with create-next-app. It's designed as a minimal, performance-focused starting point for showcasing your work, blogs, and projects.","This theme is generally aimed at developers and designers who want to create a personal website quickly and easily. Yes, I'm aware there are many other templates and themes available...you can literally find them all over the internet. The personal goal of building this theme was to get familiar with Next.js, and improve skills in React and TypeScript.","I also wanted to create a starter template for myself, since none of the existing templates met my exact design and functionality needs, without requiring extensive modifications. So...here we are! Feel free to use this a